  "question": {
    "text": "Let the point at which the circle passing through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;touches the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math> is <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, then <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
  },
